%% 图 9-2：PR-04 并发双花评审时序
sequenceDiagram
    participant R as 风险路由
    participant T as 并发测试
    participant C as Correctness Agent
    participant A as 仲裁器
    participant H as 人类审批者
    R->>R: 命中 money + database-transaction
